abstract: >
  An AI-powered O-RAN fronthaul network optimization platform for topology
  detection, capacity estimation, traffic analytics, and explainable network
  intelligence. The framework integrates machine learning, statistical modeling,
  Monte Carlo simulation, SHAP explainability, and interactive visualization
  to support intelligent telecom network planning and optimization.

